1. Don't try to execute the same thing more then 3 times. When that happens tell to switch strategy
2. Never connect between the Auth aspect of the extension and the features in the extension.
3. Always explain plans in plain English for a non-technical founder before writing code.
4. If a session is found, setLoading(false) must be called immediately.
5. Use @Codebase to find files; do not guess file names.